      "text": "For every finite raster B of pixels in Z^2 and every pixel p not in B, enclosed(insert p B) - C8(insert p B) + euler(insert p B) = enclosed(B) - C8(B) + euler(B), with C8 the number of 8-components of B, enclosed the number of finite 4-components of Z^2 minus B, and euler = V - E + F of the cubical complex of B (Candidate.main). The same file also proves, as the auxiliary theorem bridge_eq, that enclosed(B) = C8(B) - euler(B) for every finite raster B.",
